  "description": "Gong U-Jin is a passionate salesman at Bubble Doll, a doll toy company for girls! You fell in love with a married man with a child you met by chance? Gong U-Jin and Lee Do-Hyeon's relationship develops due to successive coincidences.\n\n① A married man\n② The father of a child\n③ A lot older\n④ Straight, maybe? \n\nEven though he can see the mountain he has to overcome, U-Jin can't control himself, he's still attracted to Lee Do-Hyeon... What will this couple's fate be?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
